etic Properties (due to different electronic configurations)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Optical isomerism remains unchanged (inactive in both cases).</p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is :</p>\n<p>Option B: A, B, and D (Geometry, Geometrical Isomerism, and Magnetic Properties).</p>\n"
